## Purpose

This diagram illustrates the end-to-end customer journey from initial enquiry through to a confirmed booking.

The objective is to show the interaction between the customer and the Go Cape Tours platform, together with the key business entities created during the process.

The diagram represents the business process only and is independent of technical implementation.

---

