## Business Entities Created

| Step | Business Entity |
|------|-----------------|
| Submit Enquiry | Enquiry |
| Prepare Quote | Quote |
| Confirm Booking | Booking |
| Build Itinerary | Itinerary |
| Receive Payment | Payment |
| Issue Invoice | Invoice |
| Generate Documents | Document |
| Send Notifications | Notification |

---

## Notes

- The process follows the primary commercial journey.
- Supporting supplier synchronisation is covered in BA-005.
- Operational delivery is covered in BA-006.
- Exception paths (declined quotes, failed payments, cancellations, refunds) are intentionally excluded and documented separately within the Business Process Model.
